From 7f763a64551865bedee9e1d42c019b4174bc0311 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 18:55:48 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Replace the Just Putzit logo and app icons with the new mark

The supplied artwork is a stacked lockup (two high-fiving figures above a
"just Putzit" wordmark) rather than a horizontal bar, so the UI placements
were re-sized for the new ~1.38:1 aspect ratio instead of reusing the old
fixed heights and the 136px max-width.

Assets (content-addressed, same <stem>_<hash8>.png convention as before,
generated from the supplied 1024x576 WebP):
  justputzit-logo-transparent_def33678.png   732x531  transparent lockup
  icon-192_c196efd7.png                      192x192  opaque white
  icon-512_d3d75bc3.png                      512x512  opaque white
  icon-maskable-512_42467363.png             512x512  safe-area padded
  just-putzit-og-image_b5de2dfe.png          1024x1024 opaque social card

The three app icons are generated from the figures mark only (the wordmark
would be unreadable at launcher sizes), composited on white so they render
the same on every launcher background.

Places updated: the Navbar, landing header, event detail and city landing
<img> tags, the PWA manifest (icons + both shortcut icons), the
apple-touch-icon, og:image/twitter:image (now a 1024px card instead of the
192px icon) and useSEO's DEFAULT_OG_IMAGE.

The four old brand files are deleted; sally-advisor and the social games art
reference are untouched. A new brandAssets test keeps every /brand/ path
resolvable and pins the single shared lockup so the old and new logos cannot
drift apart again.

Note: the supplied artwork clips the left edge of the leading "j" in "just".
The crop keeps it as drawn; the source asset should be fixed by the designer.
